# Documents, preview, embeddings

## Preview / content-stream

- `GET /api/v1/documents/{id}/content-stream` is served by this API (**`:9090`**).
- Clients must build stream URLs with the API base (`buildApiUrl`), never `window.location.origin` on Expo web (`:9091`) — that yields “Unmatched Route”.
- `SecurityHeadersMiddleware`: for `/content-stream`, set `Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors *`. **Never** `response.headers.pop(...)` — Starlette `MutableHeaders` has no `.pop`.

## MIME / Gmail

- New Gmail ingest stores `type="text/plain"`. Legacy rows may still be `txt`; `_document_media_type` maps short types for `/content` and `/content-stream`.
- Treat Gmail / `txt` as text in inspector UIs (client-side).

## Embedding “None” lag

- Per-item coverage is cached in-process (`reindex_service`); API and worker caches are **not** shared.
- After ingest/reindex: invalidate cache; document list coverage should use `?skip_cache=true`.
- TTL is deliberately short (~15s).

## Reindex

- Durable `REINDEX` jobs update `UploadedDocument` status; re-raise embed rate limits for defer/retry (do not count 429 as permanent failure).
- Recover empty `text_content` from connector staging when possible; do not `.strip()` PDF/DOCX binaries.
- Clear orphaned `reindex_jobs` rows stuck `running` with no active `BackgroundJob` before blocking a new run.
